# Domain rules

- Pure functions / classes only. **No** `langchain*` / LLM imports in `domain/`.
- Numbers, pivots, movement-type logic, BOM existence, order dedupe belong here — not in prompts.
- Every public rule function should be covered by `server/tests/domain/`.
- Return typed structures (dataclasses or plain dicts); nodes adapt them into graph state / messages.
- Fail loudly on missing required columns; do not silently invent business values.
